            "Quote returns a `diff` if anything changed",
            "`POST /orders`: `quote_id` + `Idempotency-Key`"
          ],
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "6. Idempotency and Consistency",
          "items": [
            "Coupon: eligibility, per-user limit, min order value",
            "Reserve it atomically: Redis `DECR` or row lock",
            "Price lock: signed `quote_id` held ==10 min==",
            "A retried POST returns the same order"
          ],
          "ink": "green"
        },
